    "title": "sklearn.gaussian_process.regression_models.quadratic — scikit-learn 0.16.1 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# `sklearn.gaussian_process.regression_models`.quadratic¶\n\n- \n`sklearn.gaussian_process.regression_models.``quadratic` (*x* )[source]¶\n- Second order polynomial (quadratic, p = n*(n-1)/2+n+1) regression model. \n  - x –> f(x) = [ 1, { x_i, i = 1,...,n }, { x_i * x_j, (i,j) = 1,...,n } ].T\n  - i > j\n Parameters: **x** : array_likeAn array with shape (n_eval, n_features) giving the locations x at which the regression model should be evaluated. Returns: **f** : array_likeAn array with shape (n_eval, p) with the values of the regression model.",
    "markdown_length": 544,
